# json-gen.raku writes its corpus next to itself by default, and the size ladder
# in the README is ~1 MB of it. Generated, reproducible from the generator in
# one command, and never worth committing — regenerate rather than clone:
#
#     for n in 200 400 800 1600; do rakupp json-gen.raku --out=d$n.json $n; done
*.json
